Value VERSION (.+?)
Value ROMMON (\S+)
Value HOSTNAME (\S+)
Value UPTIME (.+)
Value RUNNING_IMAGE (\S+)
Value List HARDWARE (\S+\d+\S+)
Value List SERIAL (\S+)
Value CONFIG_REGISTER (\S+)

Start
  ^.*Software\s+\(${HARDWARE}\),\s+Version\s+${VERSION},*\s+RELEASE.*
  ^ROM: ${ROMMON}
  ^\s*${HOSTNAME}\s+uptime\s+is\s+${UPTIME}
  ^[Ss]ystem\s+image\s+file\s+is\s+"(.*?):${RUNNING_IMAGE}"
  ^[Pp]rocessor\s+board\s+ID\s+${SERIAL}
  ^[Cc]onfiguration\s+register\s+is\s+${CONFIG_REGISTER} -> Record
